<title>CHINA: China 1997 summer rapeseed output at 9.37 mln T.</title>
<headline>China 1997 summer rapeseed output at 9.37 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's summer rapeseed harvest hit 9.37 million tonnes this year, up 1.8 percent from last year, the Xinhua news agency said on Wednesday, quoting the State Statistical Bureau.</p>
<p>That marked an increase of 170,000 tonnes from last year, it said but gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
